#: ext/civigrant/templates/CRM/Grant/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid ""
"CiviGrant allows you to input and track grants to Organizations, Individuals"
" or Households. The grantee must first be entered as a contact in CiviCRM. "
"Use <a href='%1'>Find Contacts</a> to see if there's already a record for "
"the grantee. Once you've located or created the contact record, click "
"<strong>View</strong> to go to their summary page, select the "
"<strong>Grants</strong> tab and click <strong>New Grant</strong>."
msgstr "CiviGrant omogoča vnos in spremljanje dotacij organizacijam, posameznikom ali gospodinjstvom. Prejemnika dotacije je treba najprej vnesti kot stik v CiviCRM. Z možnostjo <a href='%1'>Poišči stike</a> preverite, ali zapis prejemnika že obstaja. Ko najdete ali ustvarite zapis stika, kliknite <strong>Ogled</strong>, da odprete njegovo stran s povzetkom, izberite zavihek <strong>Dotacije</strong> in kliknite <strong>Nova dotacija</strong>."

#: ext/civigrant/templates/CRM/Grant/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid "Grants Summary"
msgstr "Povzetek dotacij"

#: ext/civigrant/templates/CRM/Grant/Page/DashBoard.tpl
msgid ""
"This table provides a summary of <strong>Grant Totals</strong>, and includes"
" shortcuts to view the Grant details for these commonly used search periods."
" Click the Grant Status to see a list of Contacts for that grant status. To "
"run your own customized searches - click <a href='%1'>Find Grants</a>. You "
"can search by Contact Name, Amount, Grant type and a variety of other "
"criteria."
msgstr "V tej tabeli je povzetek <strong>skupnih zneskov dotacij</strong> s povezavami za ogled podrobnosti dotacij v pogosto uporabljenih iskalnih obdobjih. Kliknite stanje dotacije, da prikažete seznam stikov s tem stanjem. Za iskanje po lastnih merilih kliknite <a href='%1'>Poišči dotacije</a>. Iščete lahko po imenu stika, znesku, vrsti dotacije in številnih drugih merilih."

